// DEFECT (silent no-op). Evidence is keyed by the name of the act that tendered it, so
// `Retracts` in a different act removes nothing. Expected: the status returns to Unresolved.
Fact physician Identified by DrAdler
Evidenced Bool lacks-capacity
Act determine Actor physician Holds when True Supports lacks-capacity()
Act withdraw Actor physician Holds when True Retracts lacks-capacity()
.
determine(DrAdler).
withdraw(DrAdler).
?Established(lacks-capacity()).   // WRONG: the determination was withdrawn
